00:06:04.197 --> 00:06:09.035
Lucky for you, you're like the far side
of the moon that gets ignored.


00:06:09.201 --> 00:06:10.911
Hiro...


00:06:11.913 --> 00:06:15.333
Could you tone down
your wisecracks about me?


00:06:15.500 --> 00:06:17.584
Join the canoe club!


00:06:17.752 --> 00:06:20.088
Wanna join the canoe club?


00:06:20.422 --> 00:06:22.423
- Drop it, Kamishin.
- No thanks.


00:06:22.589 --> 00:06:25.009
Hey! Wanna go canoeing?


00:06:25.968 --> 00:06:29.680
Kamishin is incredible.
He started the canoe club.


00:06:29.848 --> 00:06:31.516
