- What do you mean?


00:06:33.600 --> 00:06:34.810
Canoe!


00:06:35.937 --> 00:06:37.230
Let's go canoeing!


00:06:38.439 --> 00:06:40.942
Come back!
Don't run away!


00:06:41.108 --> 00:06:43.485
Putting it nicely,
people think he's a fool.


00:07:04.298 --> 00:07:08.177
I never thought Shinobu
would get so tall.


00:07:08.343 --> 00:07:09.846
A childhood friend?


00:07:10.262 --> 00:07:14.391
He proposed to me once.


00:07:14.809 --> 00:07:16.603
Seriously? Like how?


00:07:16.935 --> 00:07:19.146
He said, "Suzu, I'll protect you."


00:07:19.314 --> 00:07:20.481
When?


00:07:20.814 --> 00:07:21.983
We were six.


00:07:23.985 --> 00:07:26.071
That was years ago.


00:07:36.163 --> 00:07:37.081
<i>Yes.</i>


00:07:38.165 --> 00:07:40.834
<i>Something happened years ago.</i>


00:09:11.466 --> 00:09:13.259
Help me!


00:09:16.889 --> 00:09:18.139
Help!


00:09:23.604 --> 00:09:26.606
Don't go! Mom, don't go!


00:09:26.774 --> 00:09:29.442
I have to or she'll die.


00:09:31.110 --> 00:09:35.032
Mom! Mom! Mom!


00:09:46.293 --> 00:09:47.418
Mom...


00:09:48.086 --> 00:09:50.630
Mom! Mom!


00:09:51.715 --> 00:09:52.716
Mom!


00:10:04.061 --> 00:10:06.855
Don't go, Mom...


00:10:07.690 --> 00:10:09.066
Mom...


00:10:19.993 --> 00:10:23.163
<i>She practically committed suicide
jumping into the river.</i>


00:10:23.330 --> 00:10:26.082
<i>A raging river's not like a pool.</i>


00:10:26.250 --> 00:10:29.168
<i>She died for some stranger's kid
and abandoned her own.</i>


00:10:29.336 --> 00:10:32.673
<i>I don't want to play
in the river anymore.</i>


00:10:32.840 --> 00:10:35.842
<i>She shouldn't have tried
to be a hero.</i>


00:10:53.902 --> 00:10:56.947
<i>Why did Mom go into the river
and leave me behind?</i>


00:10:57.447 --> 00:11:01.869
<i>Why was a stranger's life
more important than her life with me?</i>


00:11:02.535 --> 00:11:04.871
<i>Why am I all alone?</i>


00:11:05.831 --> 00:11:06.874
<i>Why?</i>


00:11:08.125 --> 00:11:08.917
<i>Why?</i>


00:11:39.615 --> 00:11:41.825
- Wait!
- Hurry!


00:11:46.621 --> 00:11:48.081
- No!
- Come on!


00:11:48.248 --> 00:11:49.249
No...


00:11:55.755 --> 00:11:57.091
Peggie Sue is so cute!


00:11:57.256 --> 00:11:58.634
This is a big hit in U.


00:12:04.639 --> 00:12:07.267
- Let's sing.
- You sing.


00:12:07.433 --> 00:12:10.604
- You have to sing too.
- You can sing, right?


00:12:10.770 --> 00:12:12.940
- Sing.
- Let's sing.


00:12:13.106 --> 00:12:15.149
- Sing.
- Hurry up and sing.


00:12:15.317 --> 00:12:16.360
Sing!


00:12:30.957 --> 00:12:38.340
<i>The flowers that sparkle</i>


00:13:13.500 --> 00:13:14.500
U?


00:13:15.126 --> 00:13:19.505
<i>U is another reality.
AS is another you.</i>


00:13:20.006 --> 00:13:24.135
<i>You can't start over in reality
but you can start over in U.</i>


00:13:25.011 --> 00:13:27.847
<i>You can live as another you.</i>


00:13:28.182 --> 00:13:31.184
<i>You can start a new life.</i>


00:13:31.851 --> 00:13:34.229
<i>You can change the world.</i>


00:13:39.942 --> 00:13:41.028
Name?


00:13:50.662 --> 00:13:53.749
- I wanna be next to Luka.
- Me too.


00:13:53.915 --> 00:13:56.125
- That's not fair.
- I wanna be by Luka.


00:13:56.293 --> 00:13:58.754
Luka, look over here. Ready?


00:14:00.047 --> 00:14:01.173
Suzu!


00:14:01.881 --> 00:14:03.549
Take a picture with us!


00:14:03.716 --> 00:14:05.219
No... I'm fine...


00:14:05.385 --> 00:14:06.595
Come here!


00:14:17.563 --> 00:14:19.692
What? Is this Luka?


00:14:19.857 --> 00:14:22.235
No. Go back. Cancel.


00:14:27.490 --> 00:14:28.658
Freckles?


00:14:30.201 --> 00:14:33.163
My gosh...
Is this me?


00:14:37.334 --> 00:14:38.585
"Suzu" means bell so...


00:14:40.796 --> 00:14:41.754
What should I do?


00:14:43.298 --> 00:14:46.634
No? Yes?


00:14:54.475 --> 00:14:56.102
<i>Put on the device.</i>


00:14:58.855 --> 00:15:01.524
<i>Reading your biometric information.</i>


00:15:02.025 --> 00:15:05.070
<i>Complete. Initiate body sharing.</i>


00:15:05.528 --> 00:15:08.072
<i>First, your vision will enter U.</i>


00:15:15.080 --> 00:15:20.126
<i>Now your cognitive function and
deep sensations in the limbs.</i>


00:15:20.918 --> 00:15:25.923
<i>Transferring your physical senses
and body control to your AS.</i>


00:15:39.270 --> 00:15:41.648
<i>Welcome to the world of U.</i>


00:16:02.836 --> 00:16:05.004
<i>Melody...</i>


00:16:07.883 --> 00:16:12.846
<i>Be my guide</i>


00:16:16.850 --> 00:16:18.018
<i>Did I just sing?</i>


00:16:19.311 --> 00:16:22.022
<i>I can finally sing again.</i>


00:16:24.149 --> 00:16:28.861
<i>I want to picture a world</i>


00:16:30.655 --> 00:16:38.706
<i>where a simple song
can make the difference</i>


00:16:38.871 --> 00:16:43.000
<i>Each day I wake,
searching...</i>


00:16:43.626 --> 00:16:50.759
<i>I don't want to imagine a future
without you</i>


00:16:51.384 --> 00:16:54.011
<i>I can't do that</i>


00:16:54.177 --> 00:16:57.850
<i>But you're gone,
the answer escapes me</i>


00:16:58.014 --> 00:17:01.351
<i>Seems like everyone else
has it figured out</i>


00:17:01.519 --> 00:17:05.566
<i>Still, tomorrow will come</i>


00:17:06.232 --> 00:17:08.443
Who's singing?


00:17:08.609 --> 00:17:09.819
What a strange song.


00:17:10.237 --> 00:17:14.199
<i>Melody, be my guide!</i>


00:17:14.365 --> 00:17:20.748
<i>It makes me sick,
why is everybody so happy?</i>


00:17:21.414 --> 00:17:24.292
<i>Do you really need someone to love?</i>


00:17:24.751 --> 00:17:25.919
Shut up!


00:17:26.086 --> 00:17:27.336
What a weird song.


00:17:27.503 --> 00:17:28.838
Stop showing off!


00:17:29.006 --> 00:17:31.090
She's not ugly but...


00:17:31.258 --> 00:17:33.259
Look at those freckles.


00:17:33.594 --> 00:17:34.761
