00:17:34.927 --> 00:17:36.096
Stop singing!


00:17:36.930 --> 00:17:41.351
<i>Melody, be my guide!</i>


00:17:42.102 --> 00:17:48.232
<i>Whatever comes, I won't back down</i>


00:18:03.123 --> 00:18:06.710
You're amazing.
You're beautiful.


00:18:09.421 --> 00:18:10.672
Thank you.


00:18:17.261 --> 00:18:19.390
No followers.


00:18:20.598 --> 00:18:23.059
The world is the same everywhere.


00:18:28.481 --> 00:18:29.566
But...


00:18:31.109 --> 00:18:34.488
I can finally sing again.


00:19:53.692 --> 00:19:54.567
Wow!


00:19:54.734 --> 00:19:56.569
- Never heard it before.
- She's good.


00:19:56.737 --> 00:19:58.364
- Oddly pretty.
- What's this song called?


00:19:58.529 --> 00:20:01.909
- No hits in searches.
- Crazy fashion.


00:20:02.076 --> 00:20:04.452
- I'm hooked on her.
- Who knows more about Bell?


00:20:06.163 --> 00:20:07.247
Bell?


00:20:07.830 --> 00:20:11.919
I've heard her sing
but she's nothing special.


00:20:12.086 --> 00:20:13.086
Yeah!


00:20:13.252 --> 00:20:14.922
- Irritating voice.
- Too flashy.


00:20:15.088 --> 00:20:16.423
Selling her sex appeal?


00:20:16.589 --> 00:20:18.092
No basic music skills.


00:20:18.258 --> 00:20:21.386
- The arrangements are good.
- Done by other people.


00:20:21.553 --> 00:20:23.555
Take music seriously!


00:20:25.432 --> 00:20:26.599
But...


00:20:26.767 --> 00:20:29.103
I can't stop listening to this song.


00:20:29.269 --> 00:20:30.354
Why?


00:20:30.520 --> 00:20:31.689
Why?


00:20:31.855 --> 00:20:33.731
It feels like she's singing for me.


00:20:33.898 --> 00:20:35.692
For my ears only.


00:20:35.858 --> 00:20:37.236
No. For mine.


00:20:37.403 --> 00:20:39.363
No. She's singing just for me.


00:20:39.529 --> 00:20:40.698
- Why?
- Why?


00:20:40.864 --> 00:20:42.615
- How come?
- Why?


00:20:46.994 --> 00:20:48.538
Have you heard of Bell?


00:20:49.288 --> 00:20:50.039
Of course.


00:20:50.207 --> 00:20:51.916
- Who's that?
- The girl in U, right?


00:20:52.084 --> 00:20:53.669
She's new.


00:21:03.761 --> 00:21:04.846
Hello!


00:21:06.306 --> 00:21:09.101
Hiro! Guess what happened!
Bell...


00:21:09.476 --> 00:21:13.480
I know. She made it onto
the U Global Music Hits.


00:21:13.646 --> 00:21:14.480
Just as I expected.


00:21:14.647 --> 00:21:17.692
No! She's being roasted like crazy!


00:21:18.109 --> 00:21:21.904
Also expected.
They're just jealous of you.


00:21:22.530 --> 00:21:25.826
If you only get compliments,
you only have hard-core fans.


00:21:25.992 --> 00:21:27.326
Minor league.


00:21:27.493 --> 00:21:30.788
In U, stardom is built
on mixed opinions.


00:21:31.289 --> 00:21:34.334
Half of them don't like me?!
I wanna die!


00:21:34.500 --> 00:21:38.005
But the other half likes you.
Be more confident.


00:21:38.172 --> 00:21:39.506
The secret to your success?


00:21:39.673 --> 00:21:41.508
I look like Luka.


00:21:41.674 --> 00:21:42.634
And?


00:21:42.800 --> 00:21:45.345
People who arrange my songs.


00:21:45.511 --> 00:21:46.346
What else?


00:21:46.512 --> 00:21:49.849
You're my producer.
Costumes, dances, and...


00:21:50.017 --> 00:21:52.685
No! Yes but no!


00:21:53.019 --> 00:21:55.521
The biggest secret is that it's in U!


00:21:55.689 --> 00:21:59.692
Its body-sharing technology draws out
the user's hidden strengths.


00:21:59.859 --> 00:22:04.698
Without it, you wouldn't be singing
but crying all the time like usual.


00:22:04.865 --> 00:22:06.532
Look at this.


00:22:06.700 --> 00:22:08.701
Search for Bell's identity...


00:22:09.369 --> 00:22:10.871
What?! Oh no!


00:22:11.038 --> 00:22:16.042
It's funny how wrong they are.
They're naming all these celebrities.


00:22:16.210 --> 00:22:18.170
So far from the truth.


00:22:18.711 --> 00:22:19.837
It's not funny!


00:22:20.005 --> 00:22:26.053
Nobody would ever guess that Bell
is a mousy country bumpkin like you.


00:22:27.471 --> 00:22:28.346
You're scary.


00:22:28.721 --> 00:22:30.891
This is the best game ever.


00:22:31.057 --> 00:22:36.063
Turning a nerdy, freckled schoolgirl
into U's superstar.


00:22:37.897 --> 00:22:40.733
This could mean big money,
but don't worry.


00:22:40.901 --> 00:22:44.904
I'll anonymously donate
every dollar to charities.


00:22:46.740 --> 00:22:50.536
<i>Fly through this untold,
nameless moment</i>


00:22:50.702 --> 00:22:53.830
<i>Reaching out for the crescent moon</i>


00:22:54.373 --> 00:22:56.165
Bell is our new diva.


00:22:56.333 --> 00:23:00.253
Isn't B-E-L-L-E
more suitable for her?


00:23:00.421 --> 00:23:02.923
- Belle?
- "Beautiful" in French.


00:23:03.089 --> 00:23:06.300
A perfect name for a girl
who's not quite perfect.


00:23:06.468 --> 00:23:09.637
Putting it mildly, Belle is the best!


00:23:10.096 --> 00:23:14.101
This has got to be a joke!
Why is she more popular than me?!


00:23:14.268 --> 00:23:15.602
- It's Peggie Sue.
- She's finished.


00:23:15.769 --> 00:23:18.855
What? Hey! Get away from me!


00:23:21.442 --> 00:23:24.028
You jealous creeps!


00:23:24.193 --> 00:23:26.739
Belle has changed the world!


00:23:26.904 --> 00:23:32.201
More excitement! More spotlight!
Belle is the best!


00:23:35.913 --> 00:23:37.458
What's so funny, Hiroka?!


00:23:38.416 --> 00:23:40.461
This room is off limits now.


00:24:18.332 --> 00:24:22.502
You can use closed school buildings
for community activities.


00:24:22.669 --> 00:24:25.422
Let's take a look over there.


00:24:29.926 --> 00:24:34.347
Weird, huh? Practicing for
a Christmas concert with cicadas.


00:24:34.847 --> 00:24:36.682
Come out and sing.


00:24:36.849 --> 00:24:37.976
I can't.


00:24:38.143 --> 00:24:41.645
Only a bell cricket sings
in the shadows like that.


00:24:41.813 --> 00:24:43.522
I don't mind
being a bell cricket.


00:24:43.690 --> 00:24:45.857
The youngest member
should sing in the center.


00:24:46.025 --> 00:24:46.858
I don't want to.


00:24:47.026 --> 00:24:49.528
Kids these days lack ambition.


00:24:49.695 --> 00:24:51.197
Don't you want to be happy?


00:24:51.364 --> 00:24:54.534
I'm sure your mom wants you
to be happy.


00:24:54.701 --> 00:24:56.326
Happy? How?


00:24:57.703 --> 00:24:59.163
How can I find happiness?


00:25:00.205 --> 00:25:01.374
Well...


00:25:01.540 --> 00:25:02.875
Happiness...


00:25:03.041 --> 00:25:04.210
Happiness?


00:25:04.376 --> 00:25:06.796
Happiness?


00:25:06.962 --> 00:25:12.009
Even at this age,
I'm not sure what happiness is.


00:25:18.223 --> 00:25:20.727
Why are you looking at us like that?


00:25:20.893 --> 00:25:23.563
Trying to figure out who's right?


00:25:23.730 --> 00:25:29.192
We wouldn't be so frustrated if
there was a right answer to happiness!


00:25:36.075 --> 00:25:37.743
Why are you crying?


00:25:39.912 --> 00:25:41.873
Why won't you say something?


00:25:50.256 --> 00:25:51.257
Suzu.


00:25:53.175 --> 00:25:54.426
Shinobu!


00:25:54.594 --> 00:25:55.720
How's your dad?


00:25:55.886 --> 00:25:57.930
Fine... I think...


00:25:58.096 --> 00:26:01.267
You think?
Are you eating properly?


00:26:01.433 --> 00:26:02.559
Yeah...


00:26:03.978 --> 00:26:04.811
What's the matter?


00:26:06.564 --> 00:26:08.273
- Nothing.
- I don't believe you.


00:26:08.441 --> 00:26:10.442
- I swear...
- Look at me.


00:26:11.693 --> 00:26:12.737
I can't.


00:26:12.903 --> 00:26:13.945
Look at me.


00:26:19.951 --> 00:26:20.827
Tell me.


00:26:23.455 --> 00:26:24.332
Tell me.


00:26:30.462 --> 00:26:33.215
Suzu... Suzu!


00:26:37.636 --> 00:26:42.099
Shinobu, I'm not the girl
you knew in elementary school.


00:26:42.933 --> 00:26:45.978
You don't have to worry about me...


00:26:46.395 --> 00:26:47.521
anymore...


00:27:17.175 --> 00:27:20.262
<i>Coming up at U standard time 20:25</i>


00:27:20.430 --> 00:27:25.143
<i>the biggest concert by Belle
in the spherical stadium.</i>


00:27:25.308 --> 00:27:27.394
<i>Setting a record
as a newcomer to U</i>


00:27:27.561 --> 00:27:32.316
<i>she's expected to draw millions
and millions of viewers worldwide.</i>


00:27:32.482 --> 00:27:36.445
<i>People are waiting
on the edge of their seats.</i>


00:28:54.315 --> 00:28:55.525
Thank you.


00:29:35.314 --> 00:29:36.982
Belle, you're doing great.
Next song.


00:29:37.150 --> 00:29:38.151
Okay.


00:29:46.784 --> 00:29:48.536
Who opened the dome?!


00:29:50.997 --> 00:29:52.123
Get out of here!


00:29:52.289 --> 00:29:53.165
He's being chased?


00:30:03.175 --> 00:30:05.053
Who is that?


00:30:07.930 --> 00:30:08.722
Dragon?


00:30:08.890 --> 00:30:11.349
An ugly monster that lives in U.


00:30:21.193 --> 00:30:22.862
- Wow.
- Who is it?


00:30:23.028 --> 00:30:25.865
He fights in the martial arts arena.


00:30:26.031 --> 00:30:28.201
The record holder of consecutive wins.


00:30:28.367 --> 00:30:30.202
But he fights dirty.


00:30:30.369 --> 00:30:31.328
Like how?


00:30:37.710 --> 00:30:38.752
Go!


00:30:44.384 --> 00:30:45.550
He ruins the matches.


00:30:45.718 --> 00:30:48.261
He attacks until the data breaks down.


00:30:48.429 --> 00:30:50.306
Like he's venting his anger.


00:30:50.472 --> 00:30:53.518
He wants to show off
the bruises on his back.


00:30:53.851 --> 00:30:57.313
He's covered in bruises.


00:31:07.406 --> 00:31:08.574
Who's chasing him?


00:31:08.740 --> 00:31:10.451
- The Justices.
- Justices?


00:31:11.243 --> 00:31:14.372
They claim to be the protectors
of justice and order in U.


00:31:15.080 --> 00:31:16.624
They look like superheroes.


00:31:34.892 --> 00:31:36.269
How brutal!


00:31:36.435 --> 00:31:38.438
You've taken this too far!


00:31:38.604 --> 00:31:40.147
Is everything about you?!


00:31:40.772 --> 00:31:43.608
- Yeah!
- You ruined Belle's concert!


00:31:43.776 --> 00:31:44.986
Take responsibility!


00:31:45.153 --> 00:31:47.113
- Apologize to Belle!
- You wasted our time!


00:31:47.279 --> 00:31:49.615
- Get out of here!
- Leave!


00:31:53.744 --> 00:31:54.871
Hey...


00:31:57.539 --> 00:31:59.916
Who are you?


00:32:01.794 --> 00:32:03.003
Who...?


00:32:03.587 --> 00:32:04.422
Don't look.


00:32:06.048 --> 00:32:08.550
Don't look at me.


00:32:12.305 --> 00:32:13.346
Beast!


00:32:14.473 --> 00:32:17.602
Unforgivable.
You will not get away with this!


00:32:18.144 --> 00:32:21.230
We have to get rid of the Beast
to maintain peace in U.


00:32:21.396 --> 00:32:22.481
Is he the leader?


00:32:22.647 --> 00:32:23.982
Yeah. That's Justin.


00:32:24.317 --> 00:32:25.359
Look.


00:32:37.329 --> 00:32:41.166
The light of truth that protects
justice and order in U.


00:32:41.334 --> 00:32:45.337
We'll unveil the horrible Beast!


00:32:46.838 --> 00:32:48.840
Look at all those sponsors.


00:32:49.008 --> 00:32:50.926
- Unveil?
- Yes, unveil.


00:33:01.520 --> 00:33:02.521
Close it!


00:33:16.993 --> 00:33:21.708
You're finished, Beast.
I'm going to reveal your ugly "Origin."


00:33:21.874 --> 00:33:23.625
Yeah! Do it!


00:33:41.309 --> 00:33:42.185
Get him!


00:33:51.237 --> 00:33:54.281
Jerk! You could've hurt Belle!


00:34:20.431 --> 00:34:23.726
No... This is unacceptable.


00:34:30.443 --> 00:34:32.902
I will unveil him one day!


00:34:37.449 --> 00:34:40.411
Who are you?


00:34:49.628 --> 00:34:52.172
There. See you later.


00:34:52.798 --> 00:34:55.134
Suzu, dinner?


00:34:57.887 --> 00:34:59.514
How about seafood?


00:35:01.264 --> 00:35:02.099
Okay.


00:35:07.146 --> 00:35:08.313
I'm so sorry.


00:35:12.443 --> 00:35:14.320
Ow!


00:35:15.153 --> 00:35:20.159
It's that Beast guy's fault.
He should get unveiled already.


00:35:20.326 --> 00:35:22.327
Why does he
annoy people on purpose?


00:35:22.494 --> 00:35:23.996
He thinks he's cool.


00:35:24.163 --> 00:35:25.664
There must be a reason.


00:35:25.831 --> 00:35:26.958
He's just showing off.


00:35:27.333 --> 00:35:28.333
You think so?


00:35:28.501 --> 00:35:31.086
We should unveil him ourselves.


00:35:33.672 --> 00:35:36.007
Kamishin, what's with that huge bag?


00:35:36.175 --> 00:35:39.010
I have an away match.
You too?


00:35:39.177 --> 00:35:40.887
I'm not like you.


00:35:43.181 --> 00:35:47.686
The AS is constantly in sync
with the user's biometric info.


00:35:47.853 --> 00:35:50.690
So you can't have two avatars.


00:35:51.690 --> 00:35:53.693
I searched all over the Internet


00:35:53.860 --> 00:35:57.195
but there's no data about
his nationality, age, or gender.


00:35:57.362 --> 00:36:00.365
Only that he suddenly appeared
7 months ago.


00:36:00.532 --> 00:36:01.867
There's no way to find him?


00:36:02.034 --> 00:36:03.119
Not the user.


00:36:03.536 --> 00:36:07.039
But there are records
of his past opponents.


00:36:07.206 --> 00:36:07.998
I see.


00:36:08.166 --> 00:36:12.545
In 7 months, he won 369 matches,
lost 3, and tied in 2.


00:36:12.711 --> 00:36:18.717
Most of his 374 opponents have
other SNS accounts linked with U.


00:36:19.177 --> 00:36:22.179
We should talk to them
and see what they know.


00:36:31.396 --> 00:36:32.398
Wow.


00:36:35.318 --> 00:36:37.862
A question to the Beast's opponents.


00:36:38.028 --> 00:36:38.945
Who is he?


00:36:39.572 --> 00:36:40.572
A mystery.


00:36:40.739 --> 00:36:42.367
Definitely not AI.


00:36:42.532 --> 00:36:43.576
Excessively aggressive.


00:36:43.742 --> 00:36:44.744
Bad personality.


00:36:45.077 --> 00:36:47.079
- Why does he...
- Take things so far?


00:36:47.246 --> 00:36:49.206
I was one of his first opponents.


00:36:49.539 --> 00:36:51.583
He didn't have as many bruises.


00:36:51.751 --> 00:36:53.585
They're battle scars?


00:36:53.753 --> 00:36:56.422
The few of you who beat him.


00:36:56.588 --> 00:36:58.632
How did you win?


00:36:59.425 --> 00:37:00.592
He suddenly threw the match.


00:37:01.094 --> 00:37:02.969
He got distracted.


00:37:04.889 --> 00:37:05.847
Angel...


00:37:06.349 --> 00:37:07.516
Do you know something?


00:37:11.436 --> 00:37:13.106
Any rumors?


00:37:13.271 --> 00:37:15.023
- No.
- Maybe it's him.


00:37:15.190 --> 00:37:16.943
- Him?
- With the bruises.


00:37:17.110 --> 00:37:18.110
Who?


00:37:23.782 --> 00:37:26.994
Jellinek, an obscure modern artist.


00:37:27.869 --> 00:37:31.289
He started getting tattoos
that look like bruises


00:37:31.456 --> 00:37:34.126
around the time
the Beast showed up.


00:37:34.293 --> 00:37:37.463
The value of his artwork
has increased 20 times.


00:37:37.880 --> 00:37:39.090
That's suspicious.


00:37:39.590 --> 00:37:41.134
His agent's contact info.


00:37:41.300 --> 00:37:42.635
Let's call him.


00:37:42.802 --> 00:37:44.052
Are you serious?!


00:37:46.139 --> 00:37:47.139
I have nothing to say.


00:37:47.306 --> 00:37:48.474
Why the tattoos?


00:37:48.641 --> 00:37:49.809
Who are you?!


00:37:49.976 --> 00:37:52.478
What were you doing last night?


00:37:52.644 --> 00:37:53.980
Stop bugging me!


00:37:54.146 --> 00:37:54.981
Why won't you tell us?


00:37:55.148 --> 00:37:56.023
Leave me alone!


00:37:58.317 --> 00:38:00.277
He's definitely hiding something.


00:38:04.114 --> 00:38:06.159
- Who else could it be?
- I don't know.


00:38:06.324 --> 00:38:07.994
I know someone like that.


00:38:08.161 --> 00:38:09.661
Someone annoying.


00:38:09.829 --> 00:38:11.664
She always says,
"You hurt me."


00:38:11.831 --> 00:38:13.206
Yeah. Maybe it's her.


00:38:13.623 --> 00:38:14.500
A woman?


00:38:14.666 --> 00:38:16.668
I was at a birthday party.


00:38:16.835 --> 00:38:17.836
Birthday party?


00:38:18.003 --> 00:38:19.338
For my husband.


00:38:19.505 --> 00:38:23.842
A lot of preparing but my daughters
helped me bake the cake.


00:38:24.010 --> 00:38:26.012
I'm looking at your Instagram.


00:38:26.179 --> 00:38:28.347
- Are you?
- You have a lovely family.


00:38:28.514 --> 00:38:33.353
Are you sure I'm the ideal housewife
for your article?


00:38:33.518 --> 00:38:37.023
Absolutely. Please share
your happiness with our readers.


00:38:37.190 --> 00:38:40.025
We'll be in touch.


00:38:40.193 --> 00:38:42.362
She doesn't seem like
a bad person.


00:38:42.527 --> 00:38:46.532
She was lying through her teeth.
No family. No homemade cake.


00:38:47.532 --> 00:38:51.704
She's been living off Amazon
and Uber Eats for months.


00:38:51.871 --> 00:38:55.041
All her photos are stock photos.


00:38:55.708 --> 00:38:57.710
Even this and this and this.


00:38:57.876 --> 00:39:00.045
Unbelievable.
Why would she do this?


00:39:00.463 --> 00:39:06.052
No alibi. Very aggressive. If her posts
are hinting about those bruises...


00:39:06.885 --> 00:39:08.929
she could be the Beast.


00:39:15.644 --> 00:39:20.233
Fox, an MLB heavy hitter
who played in this year's World Series.


00:39:20.400 --> 00:39:24.903
Rumor has it that this superstar
has a terrible secret.


00:39:25.070 --> 00:39:25.905
Secret?


00:39:26.072 --> 00:39:30.242
About him being a violent man
wearing a gentleman's mask.


00:39:30.409 --> 00:39:35.206
He always keeps his top on
to hide all the scars on his body.


00:39:35.581 --> 00:39:39.085
<i>Every superstar has
a skeleton in his closet</i>


00:39:39.251 --> 00:39:42.838
<i>that disillusions us
time and time again.</i>


00:39:43.588 --> 00:39:45.590
Hi. I'm Gogo Doggo.


00:39:45.757 --> 00:39:46.925
I'm Mr. Reggsignation.


00:39:47.092 --> 00:39:48.427
- Have you heard?
- About what?


00:39:48.594 --> 00:39:51.097
There's an AS popular with children.


00:39:51.264 --> 00:39:52.431
More popular than me?!


00:39:52.597 --> 00:39:53.349
You're popular?


00:39:53.516 --> 00:39:55.268
Who?! Who is it?!


00:39:56.686 --> 00:39:57.936
The Dragon.


00:39:58.103 --> 00:39:59.563
I thought everybody hated him.


00:39:59.731 --> 00:40:01.940
His hideout is called
The Castle.


00:40:02.108 --> 00:40:04.568
Everybody's looking for it.


00:40:04.735 --> 00:40:06.112
Then what?


00:40:06.278 --> 00:40:08.697
- I want a selfie with him.
- A handshake.


00:40:08.864 --> 00:40:10.115
I thought he was a bad guy.


00:40:10.282 --> 00:40:11.451
Silent and cool.


00:40:11.617 --> 00:40:13.327
He's quiet but strong.


00:40:13.494 --> 00:40:14.786
Aren't you afraid of him?


00:40:14.954 --> 00:40:18.750
The Dragon is... my hero.


00:40:19.708 --> 00:40:20.960
Hero...


00:40:23.463 --> 00:40:25.965
It's just me and my boys.


00:40:26.132 --> 00:40:29.260
They don't have a mother
but they're happy.


00:40:29.802 --> 00:40:33.056
We get along great and enjoy life...


00:40:35.974 --> 00:40:38.143
He's an old homie of mine.


00:40:38.311 --> 00:40:40.146
We just clicked.


00:40:40.313 --> 00:40:42.815
He's actually filthy rich.


00:40:42.981 --> 00:40:46.902
Click here if you want to know
where his mansion is.


00:40:47.070 --> 00:40:48.905
Who's the Dragon?


00:40:49.322 --> 00:40:50.447
Who is he?


00:40:50.989 --> 00:40:52.324
What's his real identity?


00:40:52.492 --> 00:40:53.784
Who is he?


00:40:59.831 --> 00:41:02.335
Mrs. Tsutsui, two lunch specials!


00:41:02.668 --> 00:41:03.835
Okay.


00:41:04.670 --> 00:41:07.005
It's definitely not a publicity stunt.


00:41:07.172 --> 00:41:11.177
I'm still mourning for a loved one
who died in an accident.


00:41:11.344 --> 00:41:14.304
I put the tattoos where
my lover was scarred.


00:41:15.806 --> 00:41:18.349
I guess everybody has a secret.


00:41:18.516 --> 00:41:22.853
They disclose a small secret
to protect a bigger one.


00:41:23.021 --> 00:41:24.021
You're a cynic.


00:41:24.188 --> 00:41:28.025
We have to find out
what he's really trying to hide.


00:41:28.193 --> 00:41:29.860
Everybody has a secret.


00:41:30.027 --> 00:41:31.028
You too.


00:41:31.195 --> 00:41:32.530
- And you.
- Me?


00:41:32.697 --> 00:41:34.032
I have no secrets.


00:41:34.199 --> 00:41:37.536
Your phone's wallpaper is
a photo of Mr. Terada.


00:41:37.702 --> 00:41:40.539
- The physics teacher.
- Shush! Not here!


00:41:40.706 --> 00:41:42.123
Here you go.


00:41:43.541 --> 00:41:47.545
I'm just a face in the crowd to him.


00:41:48.045 --> 00:41:50.382
Don't tell my parents.


00:41:50.548 --> 00:41:53.050
They think I'm a good girl.


00:41:53.217 --> 00:41:54.219
I won't say anything.


00:41:54.552 --> 00:41:57.556
If my mom found out,
she'd just die.


00:41:57.722 --> 00:41:59.516
Like the other day...


00:42:03.728 --> 00:42:04.688
Sorry.


00:42:04.855 --> 00:42:05.646
It's okay.


00:42:06.063 --> 00:42:07.065
I am so sorry.


00:42:07.231 --> 00:42:13.070
Forget it. I was just thinking how
you actually talk to your parents.


00:42:13.572 --> 00:42:19.369
After my mom died, it's been just
me and my dad, but we hardly ever talk.


00:42:23.248 --> 00:42:25.958
I know.
That's why I'm here for you.


00:42:31.338 --> 00:42:33.257
Stop moping and eat!


00:42:33.425 --> 00:42:35.594
Two noodles, please!


00:42:35.760 --> 00:42:36.927
Coming up.


00:42:56.947 --> 00:42:59.117
A castle in this isolated place?


00:42:59.284 --> 00:43:00.452
I'm right this time.


00:43:00.619 --> 00:43:02.454
Why won't you come with me?


00:43:02.621 --> 00:43:04.121
Extra lesson with Mr. Terada.


00:43:04.289 --> 00:43:05.581
Please...


00:43:09.920 --> 00:43:11.630
Are you looking for something?


00:43:12.797 --> 00:43:13.590
Who are you?


00:43:13.757 --> 00:43:16.300
I'm an AI. I know everything.


00:43:16.967 --> 00:43:18.135
I'm looking for a castle.


00:43:18.302 --> 00:43:19.637
I thought so.


00:43:24.476 --> 00:43:25.476
Here?


00:43:30.148 --> 00:43:31.650
Are you lost?


00:43:31.817 --> 00:43:33.318
I'm looking for a castle.


00:43:33.485 --> 00:43:36.862
I thought so.
I'll tell you, only you.


00:43:47.833 --> 00:43:49.501
Are you lost?


00:43:50.835 --> 00:43:54.965
You're looking for the castle, right?
Don't tell anyone else.


00:43:55.340 --> 00:43:56.382
Wait!


00:43:58.260 --> 00:44:00.387
Where am I?
I can't see a thing.


00:44:01.679 --> 00:44:03.681
They were lying to you.


00:44:04.849 --> 00:44:07.309
You'll never find it.


00:44:07.686 --> 00:44:12.273
Play with me instead.
Follow me down this path.


00:44:24.036 --> 00:44:24.994
The castle.


00:44:31.043 --> 00:44:32.376
Is anyone here?


00:44:32.543 --> 00:44:33.545
Hurry.


00:44:36.047 --> 00:44:38.884
- She's here.
- We tried to stop her.


00:44:42.554 --> 00:44:45.306
- We're in trouble.
- Master won't like this.


00:44:53.231 --> 00:44:54.065
They're beautiful.


00:44:54.231 --> 00:44:56.777
I grew them.
The secret roses.


00:44:57.402 --> 00:44:58.527
Secret?


00:44:59.570 --> 00:45:01.739
What secret?


00:45:03.240 --> 00:45:04.992
What are you doing here?


00:45:09.081 --> 00:45:10.414
You entered without permission.


00:45:10.581 --> 00:45:12.751
Um... I followed him...


00:45:12.918 --> 00:45:14.418
Leave.


00:45:14.585 --> 00:45:16.588
- But...
- Get out of here!


00:45:23.177 --> 00:45:24.012
Wait.


00:45:24.179 --> 00:45:28.224
I want to ask you something.
Who are you?


00:45:30.601 --> 00:45:31.936
Please answer me.


00:45:32.103 --> 00:45:34.438
Leave or I'll bite your head off.


00:45:46.617 --> 00:45:48.036
Where are you going?


00:45:59.463 --> 00:46:00.297
Wait.


00:46:01.590 --> 00:46:02.717
Wait.


00:46:07.639 --> 00:46:10.266
Trouble? Are we in trouble?


00:46:10.434 --> 00:46:11.934
No. Don't worry.


00:46:12.643 --> 00:46:14.688
Everything's okay.


00:46:16.398 --> 00:46:17.190
Which?


00:46:18.650 --> 00:46:21.527
Which is the real you?


00:46:28.659 --> 00:46:29.494
Wait!


00:46:31.163 --> 00:46:32.164
Stop!


00:46:43.007 --> 00:46:44.259
Suzu is in love.


00:46:45.177 --> 00:46:46.927
With a bad boy.


00:46:47.512 --> 00:46:49.347
No! Why?


00:46:49.514 --> 00:46:50.891
It's written on your face.


00:46:51.682 --> 00:46:54.186
Teenagers are attracted to bad boys.


00:46:54.353 --> 00:46:56.188
"Lonely and kind underneath."


00:46:56.355 --> 00:46:58.481
"I'm the only one
who understands him."


00:46:59.023 --> 00:47:00.525
I said no!


00:47:01.025 --> 00:47:03.445
Why don't you give him a present?


00:47:04.195 --> 00:47:07.365
I studied abroad in Ohio
my senior year in high school.


00:47:07.532 --> 00:47:12.371
There was a guy with razor-sharp eyes
who was always alone.


00:47:12.536 --> 00:47:14.373
A lone wolf?


00:47:14.539 --> 00:47:19.210
I was kind of interested in him,
so I gave him a birthday present.


00:47:19.378 --> 00:47:20.545
What did you give him?


00:47:20.711 --> 00:47:21.713
A song.


00:47:21.880 --> 00:47:22.880
Song?!


00:47:23.047 --> 00:47:26.385
I wrote a song and sang it to him.


00:47:27.094 --> 00:47:28.887
- That's so sweet.
- A love song.


00:47:29.054 --> 00:47:32.891
I saw him smile for the first time.
He said he was happy.


00:47:33.057 --> 00:47:34.893
- Did you guys go out?
- No.


00:47:35.059 --> 00:47:35.893
Why not?


00:47:36.061 --> 00:47:38.646
He was still in 8th grade.


00:47:39.731 --> 00:47:42.567
- Unbelievable.
- 8th grade?


00:47:42.733 --> 00:47:47.280
I was touched when he cried
seeing me off at the airport.


00:47:49.657 --> 00:47:52.244
I've never written a love song...


00:48:21.106 --> 00:48:30.614
<i>You want to be left alone</i>


00:48:32.451 --> 00:48:38.456
<i>Or that's what you'll say</i>


00:48:39.583 --> 00:48:44.295
<i>trying to push me away</i>


00:48:45.047 --> 00:48:55.556
<i>But the truth is
you don't want me to look</i>


00:48:58.976 --> 00:49:06.485
<i>to see what's in your heart</i>


00:49:14.326 --> 00:49:15.744
I guess I'll record it.


00:49:20.164 --> 00:49:21.166
What?


00:49:23.168 --> 00:49:24.585
So many texts.


00:49:26.713 --> 00:49:28.507
They were holding hands.


00:49:28.672 --> 00:49:30.675
- Her and Shinobu?
- Why?


00:49:30.842 --> 00:49:33.677
- They're childhood friends.
- That's no excuse.


00:49:33.844 --> 00:49:36.139
She thinks she's better than us.


00:49:36.306 --> 00:49:37.306
What's going on?!


00:49:40.518 --> 00:49:41.686
- <i>Suzu!
</i>- Hiro!


00:49:41.853 --> 00:49:43.855
<i>Did you ask Shinobu out?</i>


00:49:44.021 --> 00:49:45.190
- No!
- <i>Did he ask you out?</i>


00:49:45.356 --> 00:49:46.358
Of course not!


00:49:46.525 --> 00:49:47.317
<i>Then why?</i>


00:49:47.650 --> 00:49:49.193
He held my hand...


00:49:49.360 --> 00:49:50.362
<i>You held hands?!</i>


00:49:50.528 --> 00:49:52.364
No! He just grabbed my hand.


00:49:52.530 --> 00:49:56.534
<i>That's all? But it's going viral.
It shows how popular he is.</i>


00:49:56.702 --> 00:49:58.869
<i>They have their eyes on him.</i>


00:49:59.036 --> 00:50:00.539
I didn't do anything.


00:50:00.706 --> 00:50:03.208
<i>It's spreading like wildfire.</i>


00:50:03.375 --> 00:50:08.880
<i>They're lashing out,
venting their pent-up feelings.</i>


00:50:09.213 --> 00:50:11.382
<i>So much tension.
Scary.</i>


00:50:11.550 --> 00:50:14.385
I thought they were all friends.


00:50:14.552 --> 00:50:16.054
<i>I guess you never know.</i>


00:50:16.221 --> 00:50:19.557
<i>An all-out war if they continue
to show their true colors.</i>


00:50:19.724 --> 00:50:21.059
What should we do?


00:50:21.893 --> 00:50:25.896
<i>I'll figure out the critical path
to extinguish the fire.</i>


00:50:26.063 --> 00:50:28.650
<i>You talk to the reasonable girls.</i>


00:50:28.817 --> 00:50:29.900
I'll try.


00:50:30.985 --> 00:50:32.070
Listen!


00:50:32.695 --> 00:50:33.822
Nothing happened!


00:50:34.572 --> 00:50:36.574
He'd never date me.


00:50:36.742 --> 00:50:37.409
That's true.


00:50:37.576 --> 00:50:40.077
- Calm down.
- Chill.


00:50:47.376 --> 00:50:48.378
Hello!


00:50:51.882 --> 00:50:53.592
We're out of the lion's den.


00:50:54.300 --> 00:50:56.052
Sorry... Sorry...


00:50:56.427 --> 00:51:01.099
It's a cruel world. All hell broke loose
because it was you.


00:51:01.266 --> 00:51:05.228
No one would have reacted
like this if it were Luka.


00:51:07.396 --> 00:51:08.606
It's from Luka.


00:51:09.106 --> 00:51:12.277
"Sorry for the sudden text.
Can we talk?"


00:51:12.443 --> 00:51:15.864
The timing's too perfect.
Why would she text you now?


00:51:16.447 --> 00:51:17.615
What do you mean?


00:51:17.782 --> 00:51:19.701
Maybe she's behind this.


00:51:19.867 --> 00:51:21.327
Definitely not!


00:51:21.786 --> 00:51:23.538
She must be after Shinobu.


00:51:23.704 --> 00:51:26.416
Why would a pretty girl
like her do this?


00:51:26.583 --> 00:51:28.626
She kind of gets on my nerves.


00:51:29.126 --> 00:51:31.463
She wanted my opinion
as his childhood friend.


00:51:31.630 --> 00:51:34.590
I would've ignored her.
I'm not that nice.


00:51:39.137 --> 00:51:41.472
I can't shake it off...


00:51:54.152 --> 00:51:55.653
He's practicing hard.


00:51:55.820 --> 00:51:57.822
Yeah, he is.


00:52:01.827 --> 00:52:02.827
Shinobu...


00:52:02.994 --> 00:52:05.371
He's taking so damn long.


00:52:09.418 --> 00:52:11.628
Suzu, did something happen today?


00:52:13.838 --> 00:52:15.172
You can tell me.


00:52:18.510 --> 00:52:23.347
There's something I wanted
to ask you for a long time.


00:52:24.181 --> 00:52:25.349
What is it?


00:52:25.516 --> 00:52:26.518
You see...


00:52:28.103 --> 00:52:30.105
Um... Um...


00:52:32.606 --> 00:52:34.775
Suzu! Heading home?!


00:52:34.943 --> 00:52:38.697
I just finished practicing.
I'm wiped out.


00:52:39.864 --> 00:52:41.157
Huh? What's up?


00:52:41.532 --> 00:52:45.454
Kamishin... How was the away match?


00:52:45.619 --> 00:52:49.166
I went and raced.
But guess what happened!


00:52:49.498 --> 00:52:54.378
A coach from my top college pick
was there to watch the match.


00:52:54.545 --> 00:52:56.213
I was so pumped.


00:52:56.380 --> 00:53:00.385
But I was totally off my game.
My results sucked.


00:53:01.510 --> 00:53:02.344
Look.


00:53:02.887 --> 00:53:08.018
I felt guilty about the guys who
didn't qualify for the nationals.


00:53:08.601 --> 00:53:10.978
You qualified for the nationals?


00:53:12.230 --> 00:53:14.398
- Yeah.
- Seriously?!


00:53:14.565 --> 00:53:16.693
That's awesome!
I'm rooting for you!


00:53:17.735 --> 00:53:18.903
Rooting for me?


00:53:20.572 --> 00:53:24.076
Shinobu, if she's rooting for me...


00:53:24.576 --> 00:53:25.744
Does it mean...


00:53:27.411 --> 00:53:29.831
Suzu has a small crush on me?


00:53:32.416 --> 00:53:35.711
What? No? No, huh?


00:53:35.878 --> 00:53:37.630
Go put that way, you idiot.


00:53:37.797 --> 00:53:42.135
I was just kidding, Suzu.
Thanks for your support.


00:53:42.719 --> 00:53:44.929
- Get outta here.
- Yeah, yeah.


00:53:54.773 --> 00:53:57.983
So what were you about to say?


00:53:58.735 --> 00:53:59.777
Forget it.


00:53:59.945 --> 00:54:01.570
- Holding something back?
- No.


00:54:01.947 --> 00:54:02.947
Are you sure?


00:54:03.782 --> 00:54:04.782
Yeah.


00:54:11.789 --> 00:54:17.295
You don't have to waste your time
worrying about me anymore.


00:54:19.965 --> 00:54:20.965
Suzu!


00:54:24.969 --> 00:54:26.804
I don't know what to do.


00:55:34.539 --> 00:55:35.706
A woman?


00:55:52.556 --> 00:55:53.684
Bruises.


00:55:58.396 --> 00:55:59.356
Don't touch me.


00:55:59.523 --> 00:56:00.898
I'm sorry. Those bruises...


00:56:01.065 --> 00:56:02.358
You think they're ugly?


00:56:02.525 --> 00:56:03.318
No!


00:56:03.735 --> 00:56:05.403
Do those bruises hurt?


00:56:05.570 --> 00:56:07.114
I'm sure they do. I...


00:56:07.280 --> 00:56:08.907
You don't know anything!


00:56:09.074 --> 00:56:10.742
Then explain it to me.


00:56:10.909 --> 00:56:13.911
Just... Go away!


00:56:23.755 --> 00:56:25.507
Go away!


00:56:37.268 --> 00:56:38.353
Stop.


00:56:41.063 --> 00:56:42.398
What were you doing here?


00:56:42.565 --> 00:56:43.733
Did you see someone?


00:56:44.108 --> 00:56:46.277
An ugly monster?


00:56:53.744 --> 00:56:55.996
Are you Belle?


00:56:56.621 --> 00:56:57.956
Why are you here?


00:56:59.623 --> 00:57:01.126
You won't say?


00:57:02.293 --> 00:57:03.461
Then...


00:57:05.797 --> 00:57:08.632
I'll ask your Origin.


00:57:12.971 --> 00:57:14.139
Beast!


00:57:14.306 --> 00:57:15.974
- It's him!
- Get him!


00:57:30.155 --> 00:57:32.157
- He's scared.
- What a wimp.


00:57:46.338 --> 00:57:47.630
We'll crash!


00:57:55.222 --> 00:57:57.431
Where did the Beast go?!


00:57:59.016 --> 00:57:59.891
Beast!


00:58:09.025 --> 00:58:10.027
Stay away.


00:58:11.070 --> 00:58:12.530
Leave me alone.


00:58:29.088 --> 00:58:32.590
I think I know you better now.


00:58:34.885 --> 00:58:38.347
This is where it really hurts, right?


00:58:40.432 --> 00:58:43.059
Thanks for saving me.


00:58:45.521 --> 00:58:46.521
Belle...


00:58:48.565 --> 00:58:50.025
Master!


00:58:59.409 --> 00:59:07.626
<i>You want to be left alone</i>


00:59:09.420 --> 00:59:19.012
<i>Or that's what you'll say,
as you push me away</i>


00:59:19.804 --> 00:59:29.481
<i>But the truth is
you don't want me to look</i>


00:59:32.818 --> 00:59:38.949
<i>to see what's in your heart</i>


00:59:40.034 --> 00:59:45.373
<i>Anger, fear, sorrow</i>


00:59:46.706 --> 00:59:51.503
<i>Some nights it can be too much</i>


00:59:52.295 --> 01:00:00.887
<i>Yet you keep it all to yourself</i>


01:00:01.722 --> 01:00:05.559
<i>Lend me your voice</i>


01:00:07.311 --> 01:00:13.983
<i>The voice you try so hard to hide</i>


01:00:15.068 --> 01:00:19.155
<i>Open the door</i>


01:00:20.699 --> 01:00:27.373
<i>Open up and let me see the heart</i>


01:00:28.456 --> 01:00:30.166
<i>that hides inside</i>


01:00:30.333 --> 01:00:31.710
The secret rose.


01:00:56.027 --> 01:01:07.746
<i>I can make it on my own</i>


01:01:08.329 --> 01:01:15.713
<i>Or that's what you'll say</i>


01:01:16.505 --> 01:01:21.594
<i>It's something you told yourself</i>


01:01:21.760 --> 01:01:27.807
<i>time and time again</i>


01:01:29.476 --> 01:01:35.900
<i>those lonesome nights</i>


01:01:37.068 --> 01:01:42.030
<i>But I want to see you</i>


01:01:43.407 --> 01:01:49.621
<i>I want to see the real you</i>


01:01:49.789 --> 01:01:57.420
<i>That's all that's been on my mind</i>


01:02:01.717 --> 01:02:06.554
<i>Lend me your voice</i>


01:02:07.264 --> 01:02:14.355
<i>Show me the face that you
try so hard to hide</i>


01:02:15.106 --> 01:02:18.943
<i>Open the door</i>


01:02:20.610 --> 01:02:28.202
<i>Open up and let me see the heart
that hides inside</i>


01:02:28.369 --> 01:02:32.831
<i>Call out the words</i>


01:02:33.958 --> 01:02:37.670
<i>Anything you want to say,</i>


01:02:37.836 --> 01:02:41.590
<i>I'll be right here,
I'll listen to the end</i>


01:02:41.757 --> 01:02:46.302
<i>Let me inside</i>


01:02:47.179 --> 01:02:57.981
<i>Let me come and sit
right next to your heart</i>


01:03:18.585 --> 01:03:21.213
What's happening?


01:03:22.965 --> 01:03:24.257
Don't look at me.


01:03:26.802 --> 01:03:29.637
Who are you?


01:03:40.858 --> 01:03:45.028
"Isn't Belle doing another concert?"
"Why won't she sing?"


01:03:45.820 --> 01:03:49.449
"She must be afraid."
"It's the Beast's fault."


01:03:49.617 --> 01:03:51.159
"He should be unveiled."


01:03:51.327 --> 01:03:53.204
Let's leave him alone.


01:03:53.661 --> 01:03:55.956
We don't have to know his secret.


01:03:56.123 --> 01:04:00.585
It's not just us. U isn't just
a small chat room for classmates.


01:04:01.545 --> 01:04:03.630
Nobody can stop it.


01:04:04.297 --> 01:04:07.050
<i>The Beast threatens order in U.</i>


01:04:07.467 --> 01:04:12.431
<i>Contact us with any info on the Beast
at #UnveilTheBeast.</i>


01:04:12.847 --> 01:04:14.641
He must be an old fart!


01:04:14.809 --> 01:04:16.976
He's a young genius gamer!


01:04:17.143 --> 01:04:19.855
He's a she, a sexy bombshell.


01:04:20.021 --> 01:04:21.940
I heard he's a billionaire.


01:04:22.315 --> 01:04:25.235
I'm suing him for mental distress
from our match.


01:04:25.402 --> 01:04:27.862
Jellinek, a new lover already?


01:04:28.030 --> 01:04:28.822
He's amazing.


01:04:28.989 --> 01:04:30.615
I'm not dead.


01:04:30.782 --> 01:04:31.784
I guess not.


01:04:31.951 --> 01:04:34.202
I never said it was
my girlfriend who died!


01:04:34.369 --> 01:04:37.873
He got his tattoos to imitate
the Beast's bruises.


01:04:38.039 --> 01:04:39.541
She's lying!


01:04:39.708 --> 01:04:40.876
He's a con artist.


01:04:41.043 --> 01:04:42.335
Shut up, loser.


01:04:42.503 --> 01:04:43.420
What?!


01:04:43.586 --> 01:04:45.922
Plagiarism? Absolutely not!


01:04:46.840 --> 01:04:51.429
People think I have a secret
because I don't show my skin.


01:04:51.594 --> 01:04:56.599
The other day, someone in U
accused me of being the Beast.


01:04:56.934 --> 01:05:00.478
But I'm not a villain
nor a violent man.


01:05:00.646 --> 01:05:04.900
I want to be a true hero
for the children.


01:05:11.949 --> 01:05:13.784
Don't be shocked.


01:05:13.951 --> 01:05:18.873
I was very sick when I was little
and had several major surgeries.


01:05:19.039 --> 01:05:22.626
But I became healthy enough
to play baseball.


01:05:22.793 --> 01:05:26.797
All you kids watching this,
don't give up on your dream.


01:05:26.963 --> 01:05:30.092
I hope this message comes
across the right way.


01:05:32.969 --> 01:05:34.929
So who's the Beast?


01:05:35.097 --> 01:05:36.474
Unforgivable!


01:05:37.599 --> 01:05:42.980
Downright unforgivable! I refuse
to forgive anybody who hurts me!


01:05:43.146 --> 01:05:45.815
Are you that ideal housewife?


01:05:46.733 --> 01:05:47.943
Why a baby?


01:05:48.110 --> 01:05:50.987
Because I have an innocent heart.


01:05:51.155 --> 01:05:56.659
I don't believe you. You think
a cute baby can get away with anything.


01:05:57.827 --> 01:06:00.831
Shut up! She hurt me!


01:06:02.041 --> 01:06:04.626
Is it true Belle will sing again?


01:06:04.793 --> 01:06:06.086
It's just a rumor.


01:06:06.253 --> 01:06:07.630
I heard she's gonna surprise us.


01:06:07.797 --> 01:06:09.172
It's not true.


01:06:09.340 --> 01:06:11.675
But what if it is?


01:06:24.438 --> 01:06:25.815
Where did Belle go?


01:06:26.231 --> 01:06:27.525
Belle!


01:06:29.275 --> 01:06:34.030
Do you know why
this light is the power of justice?


01:06:36.117 --> 01:06:39.202
Normally, the biometric information
scanned by the device


01:06:39.369 --> 01:06:43.123
is converted to the AS
through a specialized process.


01:06:43.289 --> 01:06:46.876
This light completely
invalidates the conversion.


01:06:47.210 --> 01:06:51.340
The Origin of the AS is projected
here in U.


01:06:51.507 --> 01:06:53.550
This is how "unveil" works.


01:06:53.717 --> 01:07:00.056
It means I have the same power
only the Voices, U's creators, have.


01:07:01.016 --> 01:07:04.353
Have you ever wondered why


01:07:04.519 --> 01:07:08.190
there are no police in the Internet?


01:07:08.356 --> 01:07:13.862
Why is there no law enforcement in U
when it's so similar to the real world?


01:07:14.030 --> 01:07:17.742
It's a good question.
Everybody wants to know why.


01:07:18.074 --> 01:07:23.414
But the Voices insist we already have
everything we need for a fair society.


01:07:24.414 --> 01:07:28.126
We disagree.
Every society has its villains.


01:07:28.293 --> 01:07:30.963
Those who cause trouble
and disrupt order.


01:07:31.130 --> 01:07:34.257
Those who do as they please
and scoff at the world.


01:07:34.425 --> 01:07:39.429
We need the power to fight it.
We need justice no matter where we are.


01:07:39.597 --> 01:07:43.601
We need the power to crush evil.
And that power is us!


01:07:45.353 --> 01:07:47.771
The Beast... The ugly Beast.


01:07:47.938 --> 01:07:52.735
He must be unveiled
for the future of U.


01:07:52.902 --> 01:07:54.110
That said...


01:07:55.362 --> 01:07:57.572
Why are you always with him?


01:07:58.532 --> 01:07:59.574
Why?


01:08:00.076 --> 01:08:03.411
Tell me where he is
or face the consequences.


01:08:03.579 --> 01:08:06.581
If you don't...


01:08:08.250 --> 01:08:11.295
I'll unveil you right here and now.


01:08:14.965 --> 01:08:16.466
I wouldn't tell you
even if I knew.


01:08:16.634 --> 01:08:17.467
What?


01:08:17.635 --> 01:08:19.094
You don't care about justice.


01:08:19.552 --> 01:08:22.555
You just want to control other people.


01:08:22.722 --> 01:08:24.015
So I'm not telling you.


01:08:28.144 --> 01:08:31.356
I won't let you make a fool
of me anymore.


01:08:31.523 --> 01:08:34.109
You think I can't unveil you?


01:08:34.275 --> 01:08:39.072
Why don't we try? Let's see
the identity of the world-famous diva.


01:08:39.239 --> 01:08:42.576
The real face underneath
the beautiful mask.


01:08:42.742 --> 01:08:46.913
I can just imagine it.
You're probably...


01:08:47.789 --> 01:08:49.416
When the truth is revealed


01:08:49.875 --> 01:08:54.130
who would pay any attention
to your songs?


01:08:55.338 --> 01:08:59.801
If you don't want that,
tell me who he is! Where he is!


01:08:59.969 --> 01:09:01.804
Are you looking for something?


01:09:02.179 --> 01:09:03.764
I'll tell you, only you.


01:09:03.930 --> 01:09:05.099
What?!


01:09:05.432 --> 01:09:07.809
Don't tell anyone else.


01:09:10.520 --> 01:09:11.521
Buzz off!


01:09:20.780 --> 01:09:21.823
Damn it!


01:09:44.805 --> 01:09:46.474
Thanks for saving me.


01:09:46.640 --> 01:09:48.225
I'm glad you're okay.


01:09:53.021 --> 01:09:54.731
<i>He's in danger.</i>


01:09:55.565 --> 01:09:57.109
<i>I have to help him.</i>


01:09:58.027 --> 01:09:59.403
<i>I have to protect him.</i>


01:10:00.904 --> 01:10:01.947
Suzu.


01:10:06.243 --> 01:10:07.203
What?


01:10:07.369 --> 01:10:09.121
If you're in trouble...


01:10:09.287 --> 01:10:10.372
I'm not.


01:10:10.538 --> 01:10:11.832
You can tell me anything.


01:10:11.998 --> 01:10:13.250
There's nothing to tell!


01:10:30.059 --> 01:10:31.268
Suzu.


01:10:35.271 --> 01:10:36.314
Luka.


01:10:40.485 --> 01:10:42.279
I couldn't do it.


01:10:42.863 --> 01:10:46.992
Your text gave me
the courage to try.


01:10:47.909 --> 01:10:51.079
But I just froze in front
of the guy I like.


01:10:51.872 --> 01:10:54.417
Then he said,
"What's wrong with you?"


01:10:54.582 --> 01:10:55.960
"You're creeping me out."


01:10:56.627 --> 01:10:57.586
He did not.


01:10:57.752 --> 01:10:59.796
He did.
But I don't blame him.


01:10:59.963 --> 01:11:04.009
I have no confidence,
and I am pretty creepy.


01:11:04.176 --> 01:11:08.722
No way! Not at all!
Shinobu is such a jerk!


01:11:09.097 --> 01:11:10.099
No.


01:11:10.265 --> 01:11:11.641
No? Then...


01:11:12.600 --> 01:11:14.270
It's Chikami.


01:11:14.436 --> 01:11:15.479
Chikami?


01:11:15.645 --> 01:11:17.939
Shinjiro Chikami.


01:11:18.314 --> 01:11:19.692
Kamishin?!


01:11:26.032 --> 01:11:27.867
You're so cute.


01:11:32.162 --> 01:11:34.582
I know who you like.


01:11:34.748 --> 01:11:36.876
Don't say it.
I'll die of embarrassment.


01:11:37.585 --> 01:11:39.045
Since when?


01:11:42.715 --> 01:11:46.260
When we were six,
he said, "I'll protect you."


01:11:46.844 --> 01:11:50.597
I thought it was a marriage proposal.


01:11:51.681 --> 01:11:55.478
But he meant
he'll protect me from bullies.


01:11:56.186 --> 01:11:57.979
He wasn't proposing, of course.


01:11:58.939 --> 01:12:04.403
After my mom died, I was always crying
and it scared my classmates away.


01:12:05.112 --> 01:12:09.074
He must have thought
I was being bullied...


01:12:14.121 --> 01:12:15.956
This might sound weird


01:12:16.122 --> 01:12:21.420
but I always thought
he kind of acted like your mom.


01:12:21.587 --> 01:12:22.505
My mom?


01:12:22.671 --> 01:12:27.676
He worries about you for nothing
and asks how you're doing all the time.


01:12:27.842 --> 01:12:30.720
Shinobu isn't like other guys.


01:12:32.555 --> 01:12:33.849
I said his name.


01:12:36.726 --> 01:12:37.853
I'm dead.


01:12:41.439 --> 01:12:44.694
Take me to the elementary school
you guys went to.


01:12:45.235 --> 01:12:46.362
I'll come again.


01:12:50.408 --> 01:12:51.449
Kamishin.


01:12:52.493 --> 01:12:53.577
Oh...


01:13:02.877 --> 01:13:04.713
I'm rooting for you.


01:13:05.046 --> 01:13:05.922
Rooting for me?


01:13:06.090 --> 01:13:07.550
Yes...


01:13:08.759 --> 01:13:09.926
Rooting for me?


01:13:13.221 --> 01:13:15.181
Does that mean


01:13:15.349 --> 01:13:20.104
you have a small crush on me?


01:13:21.521 --> 01:13:25.109
I'm kidding. It was a joke.


01:13:27.235 --> 01:13:28.069
What?


01:13:28.237 --> 01:13:29.195
Yes.


01:13:33.826 --> 01:13:35.493
What?!


01:13:41.125 --> 01:13:43.335
Why are you running away?


01:13:43.502 --> 01:13:45.546
This is all new to me.


01:13:45.712 --> 01:13:47.131
You heard her, didn't you?


01:13:47.297 --> 01:13:49.466
- Yeah.
- Aren't you happy?


01:13:49.632 --> 01:13:50.760
I am.


01:14:09.278 --> 01:14:10.279
Hey!


01:14:10.445 --> 01:14:12.280
I don't know what to say.


01:14:12.448 --> 01:14:15.618
How about "thank you"
or "I'll do my best"?


01:14:27.171 --> 01:14:28.338
Luka...


01:14:28.756 --> 01:14:29.881
Yes?


01:14:30.591 --> 01:14:31.966
What's your hobby?


01:14:32.134 --> 01:14:35.345
Music.
What kind do you like?


01:14:37.097 --> 01:14:38.305
I like Belle.


01:14:38.472 --> 01:14:39.682
Me too!


01:14:39.849 --> 01:14:41.434
Really? Cool.


01:14:41.600 --> 01:14:44.604
I've always wished
I could sing like her.


01:14:45.188 --> 01:14:48.524
Don't laugh but
people say I look like her.


01:14:48.692 --> 01:14:50.484
You totally do.


01:14:50.652 --> 01:14:52.194
She's much prettier...


01:14:52.362 --> 01:14:57.408
No. You totally look like her.
Are you guys related or what?


01:14:59.661 --> 01:15:04.373
My family visits my grandfather
in Hakodate every summer.


01:15:05.041 --> 01:15:09.587
So... can I really go watch
you compete in the nationals?


01:15:11.715 --> 01:15:13.841
With you cheering me on


01:15:14.634 --> 01:15:17.177
I'll definitely win. Watch me.


01:15:23.059 --> 01:15:26.604
That was close.
I hope it works out for them.


01:15:26.770 --> 01:15:27.771
Suzu!


01:15:29.983 --> 01:15:31.192
Did you see Kamishin?


01:15:31.359 --> 01:15:33.485
Yes. I mean, no...


01:15:33.653 --> 01:15:35.029
- Which?
- Yes.


01:15:35.404 --> 01:15:37.073
- No.
- Which?


01:15:44.204 --> 01:15:48.251
Suzu, there's something
I couldn't tell you.


01:15:49.543 --> 01:15:50.712
Suzu.


01:15:50.878 --> 01:15:55.175
I'm sorry! Me too.
I also have something to tell you.


01:15:55.884 --> 01:15:56.760
Yeah.


01:15:56.926 --> 01:15:58.802
You see... I...


01:15:58.970 --> 01:15:59.762
I know.


01:15:59.929 --> 01:16:01.805
I'm...


01:16:01.972 --> 01:16:03.515
You're Belle, right?


01:16:05.518 --> 01:16:07.811
Belle is you, right?


01:16:10.939 --> 01:16:11.899
Suzu.


01:16:12.067 --> 01:16:14.069
You're wrong!


01:16:14.402 --> 01:16:15.194
Suzu!


01:16:15.362 --> 01:16:16.445
No!


01:16:21.451 --> 01:16:24.496
Suzu, where did you go? Suzu?!


01:16:29.626 --> 01:16:31.168
What do I do now?!


01:16:31.336 --> 01:16:34.838
How will I tell him...?


01:16:40.804 --> 01:16:43.472
<i>The Dragon is in trouble!</i>


01:16:52.231 --> 01:16:53.483
His castle...


01:16:53.649 --> 01:16:55.734
- They finally...
- Found it.


01:17:01.323 --> 01:17:05.828
We will show no mercy!
The Beast's Origin will be revealed!


01:17:08.997 --> 01:17:13.377
We will make him pay for his sins
in front of everyone in U!


01:17:18.173 --> 01:17:20.676
The Dragon's Origin will be unveiled.


01:17:20.844 --> 01:17:22.011
Who is he?


01:17:22.177 --> 01:17:23.345
Everyone wants to know.


01:17:23.512 --> 01:17:25.640
I heard he's a psycho killer.


01:17:25.806 --> 01:17:28.435
A crooked businessman
who evades taxes.


01:17:28.600 --> 01:17:30.854
Get lost, Beast.


01:17:31.020 --> 01:17:33.023
The Beast is totally worthless.


01:17:33.189 --> 01:17:35.399
He might as well disappear.


01:17:35.567 --> 01:17:37.944
- Dragon, you watching this?
- I doubt it.


01:17:38.110 --> 01:17:41.655
Kids around the world
are cheering for you.


01:17:41.823 --> 01:17:43.867
- You watching, Dragon?!
- No.


01:17:44.033 --> 01:17:45.909
The Dragon is bullied by adults!


01:17:46.077 --> 01:17:47.369
Poor Dragon.


01:17:47.537 --> 01:17:49.038
Someone, help him.


01:17:49.204 --> 01:17:51.123
Let's all cheer him on!


01:17:51.291 --> 01:17:52.542
There's still time.


01:17:53.001 --> 01:17:55.545
Cheer the Dragon on.


01:17:56.337 --> 01:18:00.716
These idiots only have one-digit views!


01:18:00.884 --> 01:18:02.635
They have no influence.


01:18:02.801 --> 01:18:04.595
They try too hard.


01:18:05.345 --> 01:18:06.472
<i>At the old school!</i>


01:18:29.078 --> 01:18:30.204
What happened?


01:18:32.332 --> 01:18:34.917
Protect our master...


01:18:41.131 --> 01:18:44.386
They refused to take us to the Beast.


01:18:44.719 --> 01:18:46.637
How could you do this?


01:18:46.805 --> 01:18:48.597
They're just AI.


01:18:50.557 --> 01:18:51.434
He's not here.


01:18:51.600 --> 01:18:54.854
Fine. Let's go.
We'll set this castle on fire.


01:18:56.021 --> 01:19:00.568
He'll come scurrying out
like a sewer rat.


01:19:03.238 --> 01:19:04.863
Look behind you...


01:19:05.907 --> 01:19:09.034
I'll tell you, only you...


01:19:31.099 --> 01:19:36.229
It's dangerous here but don't worry.
We'll leave together.


01:19:36.604 --> 01:19:41.275
If I can endure it,
everything will be okay.


01:19:41.443 --> 01:19:42.359
What?


01:19:43.194 --> 01:19:47.489
Belle... I'm sorry
I can't tell you the truth.


01:19:47.657 --> 01:19:49.158
Wait!


01:19:49.324 --> 01:19:50.159
Don't go!


01:20:22.734 --> 01:20:24.860
Shinobu, check this out.


01:20:25.944 --> 01:20:28.323
Things are going crazy in U.


01:20:30.074 --> 01:20:31.826
- Suzu...
- Suzu?


01:20:31.993 --> 01:20:33.661
Do you know where she went?


01:20:33.828 --> 01:20:34.703
No.


01:20:34.871 --> 01:20:39.333
We were just talking about
your old elementary school.


01:20:39.501 --> 01:20:41.543
Is it close by?


01:20:44.546 --> 01:20:47.716
Shinobu... Huh? Luka?


01:20:50.677 --> 01:20:52.055
You're late!


01:20:52.514 --> 01:20:53.347
Sorry!


01:20:53.515 --> 01:20:56.266
An auto-search on anything
that might be related.


01:20:56.643 --> 01:20:59.895
We have to find his Origin
before Justin gets to him.


01:21:00.063 --> 01:21:00.814
But how?


01:21:00.979 --> 01:21:04.859
How can we pinpoint one person
out of 5 billion?


01:21:05.193 --> 01:21:08.195
Where is he?
Where did he go?


01:21:09.405 --> 01:21:10.657
Where?


01:21:11.573 --> 01:21:12.951
Where is he?


01:21:13.118 --> 01:21:14.743
- It's Belle!
- Belle?


01:21:14.911 --> 01:21:16.537
- For real?
- I knew she'd come.


01:21:16.704 --> 01:21:18.247
How rare is this?!


01:21:19.748 --> 01:21:22.585
Stop it! I have to find him!


01:21:23.002 --> 01:21:24.837
Let me go! Please!


01:21:26.672 --> 01:21:27.923
Belle is gonna sing again!


01:21:28.091 --> 01:21:29.759
The rumor was true!


01:21:29.926 --> 01:21:31.136
We were waiting for you!


01:21:31.301 --> 01:21:32.595
I wanna hear Belle's voice!


01:21:32.761 --> 01:21:33.887
Sing for us!


01:21:34.847 --> 01:21:38.393
Hey! There's no time!
Let Belle go!


01:21:38.935 --> 01:21:39.894
She's surrounded.


01:21:40.060 --> 01:21:41.020
This is bad.


01:21:41.186 --> 01:21:42.814
But if we go now...


01:21:42.980 --> 01:21:44.606
She'll find out we knew.


01:21:44.940 --> 01:21:45.984
But...


01:21:46.400 --> 01:21:47.777
we should go.


01:21:50.279 --> 01:21:52.823
Please let Belle go!


01:21:53.574 --> 01:21:57.787
<i>Think again carefully.
Who is he underneath the surface?</i>


01:21:57.953 --> 01:21:59.497
You hurt me!


01:21:59.956 --> 01:22:03.917
<i>Is he lonely like that woman?</i>


01:22:05.127 --> 01:22:06.462
<i>Then...</i>


01:22:07.963 --> 01:22:11.301
I put the tattoos where
my lover was scarred.


01:22:12.635 --> 01:22:15.305
<i>But his bruises aren't tattoos.</i>


01:22:18.475 --> 01:22:20.643
I had several major surgeries.


01:22:24.855 --> 01:22:28.484
<i>If the device scanned
traces of physical pain</i>


01:22:28.650 --> 01:22:30.944
<i>his real body might
also be bruised.</i>


01:22:31.820 --> 01:22:32.822
<i>But...</i>


01:22:34.490 --> 01:22:37.743
<i>Why were his bruises throbbing?</i>


01:22:38.787 --> 01:22:43.541
<i>And those child-like eyes
that he showed me...</i>


01:22:45.667 --> 01:22:46.711
Child?


01:22:51.131 --> 01:22:52.384
A kid's voice!


01:22:53.176 --> 01:22:56.011
Only he and I know this song.


01:22:56.512 --> 01:22:58.515
Where is it coming from?!


01:22:58.847 --> 01:22:59.682
Suzu...


01:23:00.057 --> 01:23:02.101
Where?! Where are you?!


01:23:19.452 --> 01:23:21.578
I've seen him somewhere...


01:23:23.664 --> 01:23:27.418
The Dragon is my hero.


01:23:27.585 --> 01:23:30.046
It's just me and my boys.


01:23:30.212 --> 01:23:31.588
They don't have a mother


01:23:31.756 --> 01:23:33.550
but they're happy.


01:23:33.716 --> 01:23:35.009
We get along great...


01:23:35.510 --> 01:23:38.262
Why does he know this song?


01:23:38.595 --> 01:23:39.471
I'll zoom in.


01:23:55.738 --> 01:23:56.823
It's Belle.


01:24:00.618 --> 01:24:03.246
So, is he the Dragon?


01:24:03.412 --> 01:24:04.706
But something's off.


01:24:05.081 --> 01:24:06.082
What do you mean?


01:24:06.248 --> 01:24:08.752
I don't think it's him.


01:24:08.917 --> 01:24:11.046
He doesn't seem to have any bruises.


01:24:16.885 --> 01:24:19.179
Tomo, what's that song?


01:24:19.762 --> 01:24:24.184
I'm working. Don't you realize
how distracting it is?


01:24:34.109 --> 01:24:36.820
Why do you disobey me?


01:24:36.988 --> 01:24:41.951
The world has rules and
I make the rules in this house.


01:24:42.409 --> 01:24:46.622
If you can't follow them,
you're no good to me.


01:24:47.414 --> 01:24:49.917
Do I have to repeat myself?


01:24:51.293 --> 01:24:52.670
Do I have to do this?


01:24:53.755 --> 01:24:54.797
Don't!


01:24:55.215 --> 01:24:56.757
It's not Tomo's fault.


01:24:56.925 --> 01:24:58.426
- Move!
- Stop it!


01:24:58.592 --> 01:24:59.969
Get out of my way!


01:25:01.429 --> 01:25:02.889
Tomo, don't listen.


01:25:03.305 --> 01:25:05.891
Who do you think feeds you?!


01:25:06.059 --> 01:25:08.936
It's my fault, okay?
Not yours.


01:25:09.104 --> 01:25:13.483
Kei, you're 14.
Why don't you understand already?


01:25:14.149 --> 01:25:15.902
It's my fault.


01:25:16.653 --> 01:25:19.029
What good are you?!


01:25:19.988 --> 01:25:22.242
Everything's my fault.


01:25:22.992 --> 01:25:27.122
You should disappear.
Go! Disappear!


01:25:27.287 --> 01:25:29.707
You're worthless so disappear!


01:25:35.087 --> 01:25:37.923
If I can endure it...


01:25:43.011 --> 01:25:46.349
I found him. This boy...


01:25:47.809 --> 01:25:48.935
is him.


01:26:08.537 --> 01:26:10.414
A poor excuse for a father...


01:26:12.375 --> 01:26:15.211
Kei, are you okay? Kei...


01:26:15.545 --> 01:26:18.131
I see. I think I understand.


01:26:18.715 --> 01:26:22.051
Kei wanted to be a hero
to encourage Tomo.


01:26:22.719 --> 01:26:24.345
I know why


01:26:25.430 --> 01:26:26.890
the Dragon is so strong.


01:26:27.056 --> 01:26:31.644
Since U's body-sharing technology
reveals the hidden "you"


01:26:32.020 --> 01:26:35.731
all this pain must be
the source of his strength.


01:26:36.065 --> 01:26:38.818
Like how Suzu became Belle...


01:26:55.042 --> 01:26:56.336
<i>Connected.</i>


01:26:58.921 --> 01:27:00.840
Can you see me?


01:27:02.675 --> 01:27:04.344
Can you hear my voice?


01:27:05.929 --> 01:27:07.805
I saw what happened.


01:27:08.390 --> 01:27:10.850
Don't worry.
Everything's gonna be okay.


01:27:11.600 --> 01:27:14.770
I want to go see you.


01:27:14.938 --> 01:27:17.273
Tell me where you are. I'll...


01:27:17.606 --> 01:27:19.234
Who are you?


01:27:20.777 --> 01:27:21.985
The first time in real life!


01:27:23.822 --> 01:27:26.408
I'm... Belle.


01:27:26.573 --> 01:27:28.618
- Belle?!
- Yeah right.


01:27:29.284 --> 01:27:30.578
<i>Connected.</i>


01:27:31.371 --> 01:27:32.413
See? I told you.


01:27:32.579 --> 01:27:35.291
- Child abuse.
- Call the cops.


01:27:35.958 --> 01:27:37.042
Should we?


01:27:42.297 --> 01:27:45.342
Do you also laugh at
other people's secrets?


01:27:45.510 --> 01:27:46.301
No.


01:27:46.469 --> 01:27:49.889
Did you enjoy seeing
how miserable we are?


01:27:50.055 --> 01:27:53.851
No! I want to help you.


01:27:54.185 --> 01:27:58.398
That's why I called.
I want to help you.


01:27:58.814 --> 01:28:00.108
Help? How?


01:28:02.484 --> 01:28:06.238
Help. Help. Help.
I've heard it so many times.


01:28:06.573 --> 01:28:10.284
"I'll talk to your father."
"I talked to your father."


01:28:10.452 --> 01:28:12.828
"Your father understands now."


01:28:12.996 --> 01:28:14.831
But nothing changed.


01:28:14.997 --> 01:28:16.498
"I'll help you"?


01:28:16.666 --> 01:28:20.127
What can you do?


01:28:21.755 --> 01:28:25.007
Help. Help. Help.
You don't know anything.


01:28:25.175 --> 01:28:29.136
Help. Help. Help.
Talk is easy.


01:28:29.304 --> 01:28:34.184
"I want to help you guys."
"I want to change things for you."


01:28:34.350 --> 01:28:37.979
You cry because you pity us.
You cry out of sympathy.


01:28:38.145 --> 01:28:39.773
It doesn't change anything.


01:28:42.274 --> 01:28:45.904
Help! Help! Help!


01:28:46.237 --> 01:28:47.113
I'm sick of it!


01:28:47.947 --> 01:28:49.114
Go away!


01:28:52.534 --> 01:28:54.203
Kei! Come back!


01:28:54.662 --> 01:28:55.704
It's disconnected.


01:28:55.872 --> 01:28:57.332
Where are you?!


01:28:57.664 --> 01:28:59.376
He doesn't trust you.


01:29:00.667 --> 01:29:03.212
He'll never tell you where he is.


01:29:05.215 --> 01:29:06.673
What now?


01:29:23.108 --> 01:29:24.775
Sing as Suzu.


01:29:26.027 --> 01:29:27.737
Make room for Belle!


01:29:39.748 --> 01:29:43.086
Now watch.
Her song will draw him out.


01:29:43.670 --> 01:29:46.840
He'll come like he did before.


01:29:47.172 --> 01:29:48.298
I know he will.


01:29:59.351 --> 01:30:00.729
Not as Belle.


01:30:01.438 --> 01:30:03.439
Call out to him as Suzu.


01:30:04.440 --> 01:30:05.774
Are you crazy?!


01:30:06.109 --> 01:30:09.112
I think it's the only way
to contact him again.


01:30:09.279 --> 01:30:12.114
Do you know what you're saying?!


01:30:12.282 --> 01:30:16.036
Everything Suzu worked for
will go up in smoke!


01:30:17.244 --> 01:30:19.413
It's the only way to gain his trust.


01:30:19.788 --> 01:30:22.876
Suzu! What have you been
doing all of this for?!


01:30:23.417 --> 01:30:28.006
Wanna go back to the old you?!
Wanna be a crybaby again?!


01:30:28.172 --> 01:30:29.673
Is that what you want?!


01:30:36.180 --> 01:30:39.725
Their identities are revealed
more or less.


01:30:39.893 --> 01:30:43.270
What can you do for them
wearing a mask?


01:30:43.938 --> 01:30:47.484
How can you get through to them
if you're not yourself?


01:30:58.286 --> 01:31:00.747
Hey! Why doesn't she sing?!


01:31:17.721 --> 01:31:18.596
Sing!


01:31:19.014 --> 01:31:21.475
Sing and draw out the ugly Beast!


01:31:21.850 --> 01:31:22.850
Sing!


01:31:25.604 --> 01:31:26.689
What?!


01:31:26.854 --> 01:31:28.524
- Shine the light!
- What?!


01:31:28.856 --> 01:31:30.734
Shine the light on me!


01:31:35.029 --> 01:31:36.323
What's going on?


01:31:36.489 --> 01:31:40.077
You're kidding!
You want to be unveiled?!


01:32:17.655 --> 01:32:18.698
What's that?!


01:32:25.329 --> 01:32:27.082
Belle's Origin...


01:32:30.293 --> 01:32:31.252
She looks so different.


01:32:31.420 --> 01:32:32.837
Except the freckles.


01:32:33.212 --> 01:32:34.756
Belle's been unveiled!


01:32:34.922 --> 01:32:36.550
Who unveiled her?


01:32:36.716 --> 01:32:38.551
She did!


01:32:39.677 --> 01:32:40.636
Oh no!


01:32:41.012 --> 01:32:43.222
Belle was unveiled?!


01:32:43.390 --> 01:32:45.768
Weren't you listening?
She did it herself.


01:32:45.934 --> 01:32:47.101
- She did?
- Why?


01:32:47.269 --> 01:32:48.395
For what?


01:32:49.438 --> 01:32:52.608
Belle is just an ordinary girl...


01:32:56.362 --> 01:32:58.988
Like me.


01:32:59.739 --> 01:33:02.201
This was our secret!


01:33:05.078 --> 01:33:06.829
Is this the music app?


01:33:08.623 --> 01:33:09.832
- Don't!
- Suzu!


01:33:19.967 --> 01:33:21.302
Suzu, sing!


01:33:21.804 --> 01:33:24.640
She can't sing as herself!


01:33:25.265 --> 01:33:26.100
She can.


01:33:26.265 --> 01:33:27.643
She can't!


01:33:27.810 --> 01:33:29.395
- Suzu...
- Suzu...


01:33:29.811 --> 01:33:31.729
- Will she sing?
- Suzu...


01:33:40.322 --> 01:33:46.994
<i>The flowers that sparkle</i>


01:33:47.412 --> 01:33:52.251
<i>The gems of our dreams</i>


01:33:54.168 --> 01:34:02.720
<i>This world is beautiful</i>


01:34:08.600 --> 01:34:14.856
<i>Though fear and uncertainty</i>


01:34:15.356 --> 01:34:20.529
<i>tie chains around my heart</i>


01:34:21.363 --> 01:34:31.122
<i>I want to grow kind and strong</i>


01:34:40.841 --> 01:34:42.176
She's trembling.


01:34:42.341 --> 01:34:44.344
The poor girl was unveiled.


01:34:49.350 --> 01:34:50.350
Belle!


01:34:50.725 --> 01:34:56.606
<i>Without someone to love</i>


01:34:58.399 --> 01:35:06.367
<i>what is there to live for?</i>


01:35:07.283 --> 01:35:13.332
<i>Come back to me and stay by my side</i>


01:35:14.041 --> 01:35:20.338
<i>I feel my heart shake
Come, ease the ache</i>


01:35:20.881 --> 01:35:27.470
<i>I'm standing over here, reaching for you</i>


01:35:27.887 --> 01:35:34.686
<i>A million miles away,
come back and stay</i>


01:35:35.020 --> 01:35:41.902
<i>It still makes no sense,
what's our destiny?</i>


01:35:42.069 --> 01:35:48.783
<i>When I close my eyes,
you're all that I see</i>


01:35:49.576 --> 01:35:52.121
<i>Come back to me</i>


01:35:56.125 --> 01:36:03.506
<i>A million miles away,
come back and stay</i>


01:37:00.939 --> 01:37:02.608
Mom, don't go!


01:37:03.274 --> 01:37:05.903
I have to or she'll die.


01:39:14.155 --> 01:39:14.948
Suzu!


01:39:15.114 --> 01:39:15.948
Suzu!


01:39:18.618 --> 01:39:21.662
Belle! Sing! Don't stop!


01:39:21.829 --> 01:39:22.831
It's Peggie Sue.


01:39:22.997 --> 01:39:24.082
<i>The </i>Peggie Sue?


01:39:27.711 --> 01:39:29.087
Belle, sing!


01:40:07.000 --> 01:40:10.712
Why won't she fade away
when she was unveiled?


01:40:15.216 --> 01:40:16.426
Damn it.


01:40:19.179 --> 01:40:20.221
What's that?


01:40:59.261 --> 01:41:04.932
<i>Sing, let your heart soar!
It brings us together!</i>


01:41:05.266 --> 01:41:11.105
<i>So sad and so happy!
The feelings flow over, now</i>


01:41:11.273 --> 01:41:16.987
<i>Our world is full of
all kinds of colors</i>


01:41:17.154 --> 01:41:22.868
<i>Closing my eyes
I still can see the stars</i>


01:41:23.243 --> 01:41:28.957
<i>shine in the sky and soon the rising sun</i>


01:41:29.123 --> 01:41:35.171
<i>Flowers, they're blooming,
oh it's beautiful</i>


01:41:36.547 --> 01:41:37.673
<i>Sing!</i>


01:41:39.592 --> 01:41:40.802
<i>Sing!</i>


01:41:40.969 --> 01:41:42.304
<i>Sing!</i>


01:41:42.762 --> 01:41:47.810
<i>Sing my song, never-ending</i>


01:41:48.726 --> 01:41:52.105
<i>Sing it through, I love you</i>


01:41:53.064 --> 01:41:56.859
<i>Always, forever</i>


01:42:27.306 --> 01:42:28.307
Wow...


01:42:28.975 --> 01:42:33.354
Kei... I want to see Belle.


01:42:34.189 --> 01:42:36.190
Is she really Belle?


01:42:36.734 --> 01:42:40.445
I don't completely trust her yet.
But...


01:42:53.167 --> 01:42:54.710
Belle? Can you see us?


01:42:56.170 --> 01:42:57.212
Belle?


01:42:58.171 --> 01:42:59.213
Belle?


01:43:01.507 --> 01:43:03.676
Yes!


01:43:05.054 --> 01:43:06.180
Suzu.


01:43:07.890 --> 01:43:09.640
Your feelings reached them.


01:43:10.893 --> 01:43:12.060
Shinobu.


01:43:13.686 --> 01:43:14.979
I'm so glad!


01:43:15.939 --> 01:43:17.983
So glad...


01:43:26.240 --> 01:43:28.911
<i>Why do you disobey me?</i>


01:43:29.994 --> 01:43:31.579
What's this?


01:43:32.914 --> 01:43:34.707
Our address is...


01:43:37.920 --> 01:43:38.921
That, huh?


01:43:39.087 --> 01:43:40.338
No... Stop.


01:43:40.506 --> 01:43:41.215
Move!


01:43:42.925 --> 01:43:44.551
- You're in my way!
- Kei!


01:43:47.095 --> 01:43:48.389
Screw you!


01:43:53.268 --> 01:43:54.395
They're in trouble.


01:43:54.560 --> 01:43:55.688
We have to protect them.


01:43:55.854 --> 01:43:57.064
But where are they?


01:43:57.230 --> 01:43:58.940
We didn't get their address.


01:43:59.565 --> 01:44:02.444
I think there's a clue.


01:44:03.444 --> 01:44:06.907
I heard the evening melody
from the monitor.


01:44:07.073 --> 01:44:08.074
Melody?


01:44:08.242 --> 01:44:12.287
One was "The Sunset Glow"
and the other, "The Coconut."


01:44:12.746 --> 01:44:15.248
The daily public announcement music.


01:44:15.416 --> 01:44:16.250
Two of them?


01:44:16.417 --> 01:44:18.502
They must be between two cities.


01:44:18.668 --> 01:44:20.546
- Which ones?
- Let me check.


01:44:20.921 --> 01:44:22.506
I have the recorded clip!


01:44:34.435 --> 01:44:37.229
- She's right.
- Good ears.


01:44:37.395 --> 01:44:40.690
What's that?
Enlarge the window.


01:44:42.067 --> 01:44:44.360
- Buildings?
- Apartment complex?


01:44:44.528 --> 01:44:47.072
- Two of them?
- Find out where!


01:44:47.238 --> 01:44:48.489
We need more info.


01:44:48.657 --> 01:44:49.658
Wait.


01:44:52.327 --> 01:44:54.997
Luka, I think I know where this is.


01:44:55.997 --> 01:44:58.833
Hold on. Where was it?


01:44:59.001 --> 01:45:00.168
Hurry up!


01:45:00.836 --> 01:45:02.171
- Got it.
- Where is it?


01:45:02.503 --> 01:45:07.634
Two tall buildings around Tokyo
between Ota Ward and Kawasaki City.


01:45:07.801 --> 01:45:09.595
Is this it?!


01:45:12.472 --> 01:45:14.224
It's a match!


01:45:14.390 --> 01:45:15.516
Good job.


01:45:15.684 --> 01:45:16.560
Yay!


01:45:16.726 --> 01:45:20.730
I'm calling about children
who need immediate protection


01:45:20.898 --> 01:45:23.692
in a neighborhood
I'm about to describe.


01:45:24.650 --> 01:45:26.362
Why not?


01:45:27.029 --> 01:45:28.197
Rules?


01:45:29.030 --> 01:45:33.702
But what if something happens
in 48 hours?


01:45:34.036 --> 01:45:35.203
I have to go.


01:45:35.537 --> 01:45:36.537
Suzu!


01:45:37.372 --> 01:45:38.373
I'll drive you to the station.


01:45:38.539 --> 01:45:39.375
Suzu!


01:45:47.673 --> 01:45:49.510
No more flights.


01:45:49.676 --> 01:45:51.720
Should we drive her to Tokyo?


01:45:58.226 --> 01:45:59.853
Is she okay by herself?


01:46:00.020 --> 01:46:01.896
It was her decision.


01:46:07.110 --> 01:46:12.699
<i>Dad, I left without saying anything but
I'm on my way to somewhere far away.</i>


01:46:16.619 --> 01:46:19.414
<i>I got a message
from the choir ladies.</i>


01:46:20.082 --> 01:46:22.292
<i>Sorry I'm always so selfish.</i>


01:46:22.458 --> 01:46:23.961
<i>You must have your reasons.</i>


01:46:24.752 --> 01:46:27.256
<i>Someone important to me
is in trouble.</i>


01:46:28.548 --> 01:46:32.136
<i>You're trying to help that person.</i>


01:46:32.552 --> 01:46:37.432
<i>But I don't know what I can do.</i>


01:46:40.894 --> 01:46:42.104
<i>You...</i>


01:46:43.771 --> 01:46:47.693
<i>You've been so sad
since your mom died.</i>


01:46:48.944 --> 01:46:50.904
<i>You suffered so much.</i>


01:46:52.698 --> 01:46:54.408
<i>It's been tough for you.</i>


01:46:55.868 --> 01:47:00.329
<i>But you've grown to be
such a caring girl.</i>


01:47:01.622 --> 01:47:04.083
<i>You understand how people feel.</i>


01:47:07.296 --> 01:47:10.506
<i>Suzu... You...</i>


01:47:12.051 --> 01:47:17.680
<i>became the kind girl that you are
because your mom raised you.</i>


01:47:21.225 --> 01:47:25.355
<i>Be kind to that person.</i>


01:48:21.577 --> 01:48:23.371
- This is it.
- Belle?


01:48:26.123 --> 01:48:28.042
You came?


01:48:28.208 --> 01:48:29.210
Tomo!


01:48:30.377 --> 01:48:31.378
Belle!


01:48:38.636 --> 01:48:42.055
It's okay.
Everything's gonna be okay.


01:48:43.850 --> 01:48:46.060
Are you really Belle?


01:48:57.904 --> 01:48:59.073
Where are you?!


01:49:00.408 --> 01:49:01.951
Kei! Tomo!


01:49:03.493 --> 01:49:06.456
You left without my permission.


01:49:08.957 --> 01:49:10.251
Who are you?!


01:49:10.417 --> 01:49:13.546
Did you make that post
on the Internet?!


01:49:13.712 --> 01:49:14.671
How dare you!


01:49:21.845 --> 01:49:25.975
Kei! Tomo! Go back inside!
Why won't you listen to me?!


01:49:26.434 --> 01:49:30.020
I'm your father!
You'll do as I say!


01:49:30.438 --> 01:49:32.939
Damn you little brat!


01:49:33.106 --> 01:49:35.443
Trying to tear apart our family?!


01:49:37.612 --> 01:49:38.904
I won't let you!


01:49:41.157 --> 01:49:42.492
Unforgivable!


01:50:45.179 --> 01:50:46.221
Belle.


01:50:50.059 --> 01:50:52.395
I knew when you hugged me.


01:50:52.979 --> 01:50:55.523
You really are Belle.


01:50:57.524 --> 01:50:59.152
Thank you for coming.


01:50:59.985 --> 01:51:03.530
I really wanted you to come.


01:51:06.033 --> 01:51:08.327
I wanted to meet you, Belle.


01:51:09.996 --> 01:51:11.038
Me too.


01:51:20.672 --> 01:51:26.386
I watched you take a stand
and realized I have to too.


01:51:26.720 --> 01:51:28.805
So I'm gonna fight.


01:51:31.141 --> 01:51:33.560
I learned from you too.


01:51:33.728 --> 01:51:38.106
You set my heart free from fear.


01:51:39.233 --> 01:51:40.359
Thanks.


01:51:43.488 --> 01:51:45.280
I love you, Belle.


01:51:46.990 --> 01:51:48.033
Thanks.


01:51:48.493 --> 01:51:51.037
Belle, you're amazing.


01:51:51.996 --> 01:51:53.956
You're beautiful.


01:52:09.096 --> 01:52:13.518
<i>U is another reality.
AS is another you.</i>


01:52:14.018 --> 01:52:16.770
<i>You can live as another you.</i>


01:52:17.104 --> 01:52:20.065
<i>You can start a new life.</i>


01:52:20.774 --> 01:52:23.360
<i>You can change the world.</i>


01:52:46.134 --> 01:52:48.219
You want dinner tonight?


01:52:50.971 --> 01:52:52.055
Yeah.


01:52:54.475 --> 01:52:55.893
Let's have seafood.


01:52:58.479 --> 01:52:59.354
I'm back.


01:53:01.314 --> 01:53:02.315
Welcome home.


01:53:03.443 --> 01:53:04.609
Suzu!


01:53:05.737 --> 01:53:07.447
Welcome back!


01:53:18.832 --> 01:53:20.001
Suzu.


01:53:21.168 --> 01:53:24.921
I saw you protect those kids.
You did good.


01:53:26.090 --> 01:53:27.382
You were real cool.


01:53:33.597 --> 01:53:35.640
I'm finally free!


01:53:36.266 --> 01:53:40.270
I'm done being your guardian.
We can just be normal friends.


01:53:40.771 --> 01:53:42.648
It's what I always wanted.


01:53:56.662 --> 01:53:57.788
Thank you.


01:54:14.639 --> 01:54:16.849
Let's sing and walk.


01:54:17.015 --> 01:54:19.226
Great idea.
It'll be good practice.


01:54:19.394 --> 01:54:20.895
For the concert.


01:54:21.061 --> 01:54:22.063
What should we sing?


01:54:22.229 --> 01:54:23.648
What else?


01:54:23.814 --> 01:54:25.358
That song, right?


01:54:25.899 --> 01:54:27.150
Suzu!


01:54:28.819 --> 01:54:29.904
Take the lead.


01:54:30.320 --> 01:54:31.488
Sing!


01:54:34.533 --> 01:54:35.576
I'll listen.


01:54:41.332 --> 01:54:42.542
Ready?

